OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal Hampden park site
OL,4,Aadvertised for let
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site of the original Hampden Park -
OL,7,Fwidely considered to be the first
OL,8,Finternational football ground - has
OL,9,Fbeen advertised for let.
OL,11,FThe bowling green and clubhouse which
OL,12,Fnow occupy much of the original pitch
OL,13,Fare described on the listing as an
OL,14,F"exciting leisure opportunity".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
