OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal Hampden park site
OL,4,Aadvertised for let
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity Property Glasgow - Glasgow City
OL,7,FCouncil's arms-length property body who
OL,8,Fhave advertised the site - say that
OL,9,F"offers will be assessed on their
OL,10,Findividual merits including but not
OL,11,Flimited to community benefits, heritage
OL,12,Fconsideration, deliverability and
OL,13,Ffinancial value".
OL,15,FFirst Hampden - a group set up to
OL,16,Fpreserve the site - say they are
OL,17,Fworking on a proposal to bring the site
OL,18,Finto community ownership.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
